; From z3guide: 04 - optimization/07 - advancedtopics.md (block 3) (MIT, LICENSES/z3guide.txt)
; statuses: the `unknown` ones answered by Z3 version 4.14.0 (statusstamp, 2026-09-03)
; logic: QF_LIA, the smallest the script fits, which set none (prune logic)
(set-logic QF_LIA)
(declare-fun x () Int)
(assert (<= x 1))
(assert (>= x 0))
(minimize x)
(set-info :status sat)
(check-sat)
